cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fastshaql in your research, please cite it as below."
title: fastshaql
abstract: >-
  fastshaql operationalizes RDF knowledge graphs as GraphQL APIs. 
  It turns SHACL shapes into GraphQL schemas and translates GraphQL queries into SPARQL.
type: software
